ce side and validate data at target side.\r\n\r\n**Expected**:\r\nReplication should happen - Inserted data(at source side) should be present at Target side\r\n\r\n**Actual**:\r\nReplication is not happening and observed below error in tserver log\r\n```\r\nI0615 07:56:02.704607 19601 raft_consensus.cc:3371] T a53ac8f8e2c049dd94c7a81f70e70b4e P ea4b0bb33f1546e1bfde94486b88c679 [term 2 FOLLOWER]: NO_OP [1.1] replication failed: Aborted (yb/consensus/replica_state.cc:612): Operation aborted by new leader\r\n    @          0x2db9825  yb::consensus::ConsensusRound::NotifyReplicationFinished()\r\n    @          0x2e00f82  yb::consensus::ReplicaState::AbortOpsAfterUnlocked()\r\n    @          0x2dee6aa  yb::consensus::RaftConsensus::UpdateReplica()\r\n    @          0x2dd51cf  yb::consensus::RaftConsensus::Update()\r\n    @          0x36d05e7  yb::tserver::ConsensusServiceImpl::MultiRaftUpdateConsensus()\r\n    @          0x2e3b9ba  std::__1::__function::__func<>::operator()()\r\n    @          0x2e3cec6  yb::consensus::ConsensusServiceIf::Handle()\r\n    @          0x3447e43  yb::rpc::ServicePoolImpl::Handle()\r\n    @          0x3397085  yb::rpc::InboundCall::InboundCallTask::Run()\r\n    @          0x3456bdd  yb::rpc::(anonymous namespace)::Worker::Execute()\r\n    @          0x3a15f84  yb::Thread::SuperviseThread()\r\n    @     0x7f4c9d8dd694  start_thread\r\n    @     0x7f4c9dddf41d  __clone\r\n```\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12901/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6971174119,"node_id":"CE_lADOBlCVUc5MwOIZzwAAAAGfg6zn","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/6971174119","actor":{"login":"hari90","id":12418230,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNl